  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers 1 and 9:\n\nOption 1) 9 × 2 - 1 + 8 = 1 ⇒ 1 × 2 - 9 + 8 = 1\n\n⇒ __**1 × 2**__ - 9 + 8 = 1\n\n⇒ __**2 + 8**__ - 9 = 1\n\n⇒ __10 - 9__ = 1\n\n⇒ 1 = 1 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 9 × 2 + 1 - 4 = 7 ⇒ 1 × 2 + 9 - 4 = 7\n\n⇒ __**1 **____**× 2**__ + 9 - 4 = 7\n\n⇒ __2 + 9__ - 4 = 7\n\n⇒ __11 - 4__ = 7\n\n⇒ 7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 9 - 1 + 7 = -3 ⇒ 1 - 9 + 7 = -3\n\n⇒ __**1 + 7**__ - 9 = -3\n\n⇒ __**8 - 9**__ = -3\n\n**⇒ -1 ≠ -3 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 1 + 9 × 3 - 4 = 8 ⇒ 9 + 1 × 3 - 4 = 8\n\n⇒ 9 + __**1 **____**× 3**__ - 4 = 8\n\n⇒ __**9**____** + 3**__ - 4 = 8\n\n⇒ __**12**____** - 4**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 8 = 8 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
